* EEEN20020 Exp. 2 - NOMINAL - MIN gain - DC operating point at vin = +0.5 V (positive peak of 1 V pk-pk)
* Run, and LTspice opens a table of every node voltage and branch current (screenshot it for Sec. B)
* Open in LTspice (File > Open, 'Netlists (*.cir)') and click Run.
VCC vcc 0 5
VEE 0 vee 5
Vsig in 0 0.5
R3 in 0 10k
R1 out inv 1m
R2 inv 0 10k
XU1 in inv vcc vee out uA741
.op
.lib uA741.lib
.end
